835
00:38:23.760 --> 00:38:25.560
Don't let North Carolina fool you.

836
00:38:25.960 --> 00:38:27.640
Ohio invented flight.

837
00:38:28.420 --> 00:38:29.580
Wow, Elliot.

838
00:38:30.000 --> 00:38:30.280
Yeah.

839
00:38:30.920 --> 00:38:32.040
Hot to trot.

840
00:38:32.360 --> 00:38:33.120
Sure is.

