And Toby says, I can't forget because I went to the Weintraub Memory Academy.

1096
00:50:08.890 --> 00:50:09.230
Yes.

1097
00:50:09.430 --> 00:50:10.310
Not real, I looked it up.

1098
00:50:10.310 --> 00:50:11.470
Not real, I looked it up.

1099
00:50:13.270 --> 00:50:16.670
Toby says, I sat next to Beverly Brooke, who ate a Greek salad for lunch.

