1110
00:50:48.390 --> 00:50:51.050
Anniversary party, three to six weeks.

1111
00:50:51.510 --> 00:50:52.190
Notice.

1112
00:50:52.570 --> 00:50:53.150
Notice.

1113
00:50:53.530 --> 00:50:53.830
Okay.

1114
00:50:54.470 --> 00:50:56.950
Holiday dinner, two weeks to two months.

1115
00:50:57.550 --> 00:50:58.310
Okay.

1116
00:50:59.390 --> 00:51:02.030
Formal dinner, three to six weeks.

1117
00:51:03.570 --> 00:51:05.810
Graduation party, three weeks.

1118
00:51:05.970 --> 00:51:06.170
Notice.

1119
00:51:07.150 --> 00:51:09.730
Lunch or tea, a few days to two weeks.

