You're not my son anymore.

1143
00:52:07.170 --> 00:52:08.170
I'm over you.

1144
00:52:08.750 --> 00:52:09.710
It's done.

1145
00:52:10.010 --> 00:52:10.910
It's a quick turn.

1146
00:52:11.130 --> 00:52:11.470
Oh, yeah.

1147
00:52:11.470 --> 00:52:15.650
Dwight is going to go warn Jim, I think the new guys are trying to take our jobs.

1148
00:52:15.830 --> 00:52:16.010
Yeah.

1149
00:52:16.650 --> 00:52:22.830
And so Jim immediately decides to mess with him and says, oh, yeah, that must be what Pete

1150
00:52:22.830 --> 00:52:25.010
