I thought you guys really had a good father-son thing going.

1165
00:52:51.590 --> 00:52:52.730
Kind of like Luke and Darth Vader.

1166
00:52:53.530 --> 00:52:53.690
No.

1167
00:52:54.530 --> 00:52:54.930
Idiot.

1168
