She watched Star Wars and didn't tell me.

1179
00:53:23.610 --> 00:53:27.990
So if you want to hear it and you want to hear Angela's reaction, go back and listen.

1180
00:53:28.230 --> 00:53:29.630
My reaction and Sam's.

1181
00:53:30.050 --> 00:53:30.890
We couldn't believe it.

1182
00:53:30.890 --> 00:53:32.910
Angela now addresses the bullpen.

1183
00:53:33.210 --> 00:53:39.930
She has a flyer for Comstock and she shares that he needs a home and she'll be conducting 20-minute interviews for anyone interested.

1184
00:53:40.330 --> 00:53:41.690
Phil Shea made those flyers.

