00:53:41.770 --> 00:53:43.930
I even kept one in my trailer for a long time.

1186
00:53:44.430 --> 00:53:46.990
Yeah, I had it hanging in my trailer for so long.

1187
00:53:47.110 --> 00:53:47.990
I'm going to try to find it.

1188
