Like I'm like, I'll put it in my scrapbook.

1192
00:53:55.890 --> 00:54:04.790
But anyway, Angela goes over her criteria for her candidates in true Angela fashion and she tells Pam she really needs to wow her, but she's still in the running.

1193
00:54:05.470 --> 00:54:05.670
Yeah.

1194
00:54:06.030 --> 00:54:08.810
Pam is like, I never entered this conteSt.

1195
